      "grammarFocus": "comparatives",
      "sentenceRef": "Больше, чем я ожидал.",
      "explanation": "'Больше, чем' can compare not just nouns but also actions: 'Больше, чем я ожидал' = More than I expected. The verb after 'чем' shows what was expected or done. Examples: 'Лучше, чем я думал' (Better than I thought), 'Быстрее, чем я ожидал' (Faster than I expected). This pattern works with any comparative.",
